{"title":"1998 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4588fd900d02afcbd260bc07f54cce49a7dc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lambda$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> be the positive root of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb021f0390f4c3741deaa02032fab4c24145b820.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^2 - 1998t - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />. The sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/9122b8abf90052d2562d0d65e906a870be18fe9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0, x_1, x_2, \\cdots , x_n, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"13\" /> is defined by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/c/3fc164702f126b2725afa2d8228c846067d45a62.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{cases} x_0=1 \\\\ x_{n+1}=\\left\\lfloor \\lambda x_n \\right\\rfloor\\ , &amp; \\text{for }n=0,1,2,\\cdots\\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Find the remainder of the division of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca66067fedc4b166086e3bcfdf559cbce0502334.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1998}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/9673ee04316e55d232ae3a9b8ce356386c0dc66a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1998$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Note: The brackets indicate an integer part, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/8713f55c70d37a64172aad91903b3c3c58354372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor x \\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> is the only integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/9/769656f17cfe0bc244d26401001560a427ac2236.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\le x &lt; k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe13.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe13.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/20971